# ── Sensitive / personal documents ────────────────────────────────────────────
# These directories contain personally-identifiable government documents.
# They should NOT be present in this repository at all; if accidentally
# staged, Git will refuse to track them once this ignore rule is in effect.
# If they already exist in history, follow the purge steps in SECURITY.md.
Presumed Personal Government Digital Database/
Personal Predicament/

# Common credential / secret file patterns – never commit these.
.env
.env.*
*.secret
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
credentials/

# Archives that may contain sensitive data
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tar.bz2
*.7z
*.rar
eUprava.zip

# OS / editor artefacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
